summary:
  The widget goes without removing the file of a reading in flight.

history:
  The helper holds on to that file. Left in place, the helper listens on for
  up to twenty seconds after the widget is gone.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                          + " " + PodcastLogic.shQuote(_icyUrlFile) + ".loud* '" + _podUrlFile.replace(/'/g, "'\\''")

replace:
                          + " '" + _podUrlFile.replace(/'/g, "'\\''")

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_loudness_engine_has_its_instance_its_answers_and_its_sweep.
  Line-neutral.
